 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "FileSystemStats(files) takes records \"<name>,<size>,<collectionId>...\" (size a positive integer, zero or more collection ids; a repeated id in one record counts once). getTotalSize() returns the sum of all file sizes. getCollectionSize(id) returns the direct total of that collection (0 for an unknown id). getTopCollections(k) returns the ids of the min(k, C) collections with the largest direct total among the C collections named in any record, ties to the smaller id in code-point order. setParent(childId, parentId) makes childId a sub-collection of parentId (ids need not appear in records; a child gets at most one parent and no cycle is formed). getHierarchySize(id) returns the direct total of id plus the direct totals of all its descendant collections (a file in two of them counts twice).",
  "provenance": [
   {
    "repository": "gamma",
    "revision": null,
    "path": "projects/algorithm_solver/catalogue/authored/hack2hire-chunk06-a-20261028-v1/contracts.json",
